59
00:05:18.092 --> 00:05:22.798
"At least I'm learning to be a good Astralian," Ally said.

60
00:05:22.799 --> 00:05:29.971
"Funny how it took being light-years from home to understand what it means to be helpful."

61
00:05:29.972 --> 00:05:35.948
"You're the most helpful person I know," Mateo said. "You're even willing to help weird Barry."

62
00:05:35.949 --> 00:05:44.165
Ally laughed. "Hey! If I manage to teach Barry my levitation trick without making a mess of it,

63
00:05:44.166 --> 00:05:55.948
